                verification runs without anyone invoking it`" \
            resolved-by="taken as the slice states it: what makes something harness is that it runs \
                WITHOUT invocation, not which directory it sits in. Recorded as Z3, because the \
                config's definition and the slice's disagree and only one of them can be right"
    }

    frozen {
